OL,3,AInspectors to assess police after Henry
OL,4,ANowak murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inspection into how a police force
OL,7,Fresponds to violent incidents has been
OL,8,Flaunched in the wake of Henry Nowak's
OL,9,Fmurder.
OL,11,FThe 18-year-old student was stabbed in
OL,12,FSouthampton by Vickrum Digwa, who lied
OL,13,Fto police and insisted he had been the
OL,14,Fvictim of a racist attack.
OL,16,FHampshire Police officers initially
OL,17,Farrested Nowak and placed him in
OL,18,Fhandcuffs as he lay dying.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
