OL,3,AInspectors to assess police after Henry
OL,4,ANowak murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis Majesty's Inspectorate of
OL,7,FConstabulary and Fire & Rescue Service
OL,8,F(HMICFRS) will assess the force's
OL,9,Fprocesses, training and how officers
OL,10,Fare supported to make sound and
OL,11,Fimpartial judgements.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
